WEBVTT

00:00:05.981 --> 00:00:08.114
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> This is Stressed Sally.

00:00:08.627 --> 00:00:11.600
She’s an administrator in a busy office.

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:14.760
She works long hours.

00:00:15.428 --> 00:00:17.746
This is Sally’s daily routine.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.271
Sally wakes up at seven o’clock.

00:00:28.605 --> 00:00:29.680
She takes a shower.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:34.386
She gets dressed.

00:00:38.004 --> 00:00:39.239
She puts on make-up.

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.408
She has a coffee.

00:00:48.146 --> 00:00:50.186
Sally goes to work by bus.

00:00:53.452 --> 00:00:56.141
She gets to work at eight twenty-five.

00:00:58.322 --> 00:01:00.621
She starts work at eight thirty.

00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:05.440
She has lunch at work.

00:01:08.958 --> 00:01:11.568
She finishes work at six thirty.

00:01:13.946 --> 00:01:15.400
Sally goes shopping.

00:01:18.742 --> 00:01:20.106
She gets home late.

00:01:23.806 --> 00:01:25.100
She does the housework.

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.567
She has pizza for dinner.

00:01:33.407 --> 00:01:35.280
She checks emails.

00:01:38.072 --> 00:01:39.949
Sally goes to bed.

00:01:48.647 --> 00:01:50.640
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> This is Relaxed Robbie.

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:52.770
He’s a gardener.

00:01:53.418 --> 00:01:55.818
He works for people in their gardens.

00:01:57.377 --> 00:01:59.588
This is Robbie’s daily routine.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.647
Robbie gets up at eight o’clock.

00:02:11.855 --> 00:02:12.688
He shaves.

00:02:19.662 --> 00:02:21.568
He takes the dog for a walk.

00:02:27.670 --> 00:02:28.897
He has breakfast.

00:02:36.104 --> 00:02:37.730
Robbie walks to work.

00:02:43.055 --> 00:02:44.341
He goes home early.

00:02:50.690 --> 00:02:52.845
He goes to his Italian class.

00:02:59.233 --> 00:03:00.561
He sees friends.

00:03:07.068 --> 00:03:08.376
Robbie makes dinner.

00:03:15.545 --> 00:03:17.352
He relaxes on the sofa.

00:03:23.151 --> 00:03:24.372
He takes a bath.

00:03:31.580 --> 00:03:33.608
He sleeps for eight hours.